      "writtenOn": "2019-08-27T18:17:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "RunCommandTargetPreparer can\u0027t understand the semantics of the commands that it\u0027s being asked to run (These commands are just passed as strings). It shouldn\u0027t attempt to combine stops/starts. \n\nI\u0027d rather we not leak device state across test runs, even though it is safe in this case, since performance impact is minimal relative to whole VTS runtime.",
